-- (it ends on the Shimmering Flats, just north). First pass (v0.2.5): reviewed in v0.3.0.
-- Stretch order: 0 Tanaris (Gadgetzan, Steamwheedle Port, the Wastewander camps, the pirates), the boat to the
--   Riverglades; 1 the Riverglades (Powderfuse Port, Rog'mar, the Twilight camps, Bolder'ok and its ring, Da'grosh in
--   the west); 2 ride south into the Swamp of Sorrows (Stonard); 3 Stranglethorn (Grom'gol, then Booty Bay), the
--   zeppelin to Orgrimmar; 4 Dustwallow (Brackenwall); 5 Feralas from Camp Mojache, east then west; 6 Tanaris again
--   (water survey, Dunemaul, Thistleshrub, the Tooga escort); 7 Azshara from Valormok; 8 Orgrimmar and the zeppelin to
--   the Eastern Kingdoms; 9 the Hinterlands from Revantusk Village; 10 Kargath, then Searing Gorge from Thorium Point;
--   11 the Blasted Lands, back to Stonard (the end).
-- Facts: givers, enders, levels, prerequisites and spots from the local QuestieDB Forever copy, objective counts from
-- CMaNGOS classic-db; all confirmed = false until the recorder backs them. xp on turn-ins: QuestieDB's Forever XP traces
-- where it has the quest, else its Classic XP table. The Riverglades boat and the way into the swamp:
-- warcraft.wiki.gg (not checked in game).
-- Ways on from 30-40: Mok'thardin 572, Split Bone Necklace 598 and the Gurubashi tablet 95748 (after 570, 596, 629 in
-- Stranglethorn); Show Them How It's Done 94483 and Ombassa 96105 (after the Rog'mar plains quests the 30-40 route
-- does). A character that skipped those won't be offered them.
-- Left out on purpose (why): Water Pouch Bounty 1707 (Forever gives no XP for it, hotfix F-30), the rest of the Muisek
-- chain 3122-3129 (its wildkin are only in the Hinterlands data, and it needs a Feralas return), Gritty Business 97534
-- (no spot for the debris), Stoley 2872-2874 and the OOX beacons (start or end far away), Scrimshank 10 > 110 > 113 >
-- 32 (a second trip into the Noxious Lair), Gahz'ridian 3161 (a detector hunt over half the zone), Sprinkle's Secret
-- Ingredient 2641+ (the tragan grows in the Hinterlands, the hand-in is back in Gadgetzan), Ripple Delivery 81
-- (Orgrimmar hand-in), Rin'ji's Secret 2782 and Lines of Communication 2995 (Undercity hand-ins), Venom Bottles 2933+
-- (Tarren Mill hand-in), the Wildhammer messages 7842-7843 (feathers at the far west end), Ledger from Tanaris 4450,
-- Look at the Size of It 7704 (no spot for the pillow), Felwood (its quests start at 48-49: 50-60), the Northspring
-- 3063 / 3062 (harpies on the far side of the zone), Zul'Farrak and Maraudon quests (dungeons). Stranglethorn:
-- Skullsplitter Tusks 209 and Venture Company Mining 600 (their camps come before Booty Bay), the Nesingwary hunts 196+
-- (one more camp trip), Mok'thardin 573 (a third Grom'gol trip), the Mosh'Ogg and pirate-captain elites. Riverglades:
-- Step Two 96026 (an item the data has no source for), Drive Them Back 95163 (the boars are spread over the whole
-- zone), the sea-monster chain 95260-95267 and See Ya, Scallywags 95165 (extra port trips), Not My Circus 95982,
-- Armory of Sunnyglade 97884 (Undercity), the Executioner 95433 (elite, hand-in in the far north), the wanted boards
-- (elites); its plains and port quests up to 42 are in the 30-40 route.
-- Optional group steps (elite above your level, QuestieDB rank): Snargl 94533, Ombassa 96105, Overlord Kilgar 94768,
-- Namida 92878, Edana 3062, Gammerita 7816, all of Jintha'Alor (7845-7850, 7861, 7862), Overseer Maltorius 7701. The
